SUMMARY:Silent Bookclub Meeting #81 (Bookstore Crawl and Riverdale Park)
DESCRIPTION:Silent Book Club (Toronto)\nThe next event will be a two parte
 r\, bringing back a fan favourite!\n\nOn Sunday July 19\, we will be doing
  our second Bookstore Crawl (think pub crawl but for books)! We'll meet in
  the East End (location TBD) and then visit a few bookstores before finall
 y ending at Riverdale Park for our regular Silent Book Club event.\n\nPlea
 se RSVP if you're planning on coming so we can plan appropriately!\n\nTo h
 elp cover the costs of meetup fees\, we will be taking optional donations 
 for this event. If you're inclined to\, feel free to send any amount you'r
 e comfortable with to harresh.s@hotmail.com\, or bring cash to the event. 
 Please note that this is entirely optional and not required to join the ev
 ent! All proceeds will go towards fees for this event and future events\, 
 as well as meetup fees.
